      "target": "올여름은 정말 더울 것 같아요.",
      "reading": "oryeoreumeun jeongmal deoul geot gatayo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "This summer is going to be really hot.",
        "ko": "올여름은 정말 더울 것 같아요.",
        "ipa": "oryeoreumeun jeongmal deoul geot gatayo.",
        "ar": "يبدو أن هذا الصيف سيكون حارًا جدًا.",
        "cs": "Tohle léto bude asi opravdu horké.",
